From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sinful1992 <sinful1992@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:58:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Fetch a page's chapters with one query instead of one per
 item

The Chapters field cost one Chapters query per item -- 134 round-trips
on a full-series episode list, and the Android TV app asks for the field
on every list it renders. ChapterRepository gains GetChaptersByItems,
ChapterManager exposes it, and DtoService fetches the page's chapters
once and hands them down. Same rows, same order (start position), and
an item the batch did not return has no chapters, as before. The
single-item path is unchanged; IChapterManager and IChapterRepository
(MediaBrowser.Controller) are not touched.
---
